  "visualBrief": "Surviving red-brick Gothic auditorium on sloping limestone base, steep dark gabled roof with two rear chimneys, ornate white-banded front with twin deeply recessed door portals/stairs, grouped lancets/offset buttresses/Union Gospel panel and large traceried gable light. Long side paired stained-glass bays, real recessed side stair portals and downpipes. Separately bounded modern rear wing with copper screen/open covered entrance, concrete steps and lower glazed pavilion. No neighboring towers or honky-tonks/interior.",
